---

<div id="cost-modal" class="fixed inset-0 z-[200] flex items-center justify-center p-6 animate-fade-in hidden" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="cost-modal-title">
  <div class="modal-backdrop absolute inset-0 bg-black/65 backdrop-blur-md"></div>
  <div class="modal-card relative bg-surface-400 border border-surface-700 rounded-2xl px-6 pt-7 pb-5 max-w-[380px] w-full shadow-[0_16px_48px_rgba(0,0,0,0.8)] animate-modal-in">
    <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-gold/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
      <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5zM2 17l10 5 10-5M2 12l10 5 10-5" stroke="#D4A574" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
    </div>
    <h3 id="cost-modal-title" class="text-lg font-bold tracking-tight mb-2">Modo PRO Activado</h3>
    <p class="text-sm text-surface-200 leading-relaxed mb-4">Los modelos PRO utilizan APIs de pago que pueden generar costos asociados al consumo. Asegúrate de tener fondos suficientes en tu cuenta y verifica los límites de uso.</p>
    <div class="flex gap-2 px-3 py-2.5 bg-gold/10 rounded-xl text-xs text-surface-200 leading-relaxed mb-4">
      <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" class="shrink-0 mt-0.5 text-gold"><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2"/><path d="M8 5v3M8 11h0" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
      <span>Los costos varían según el modelo y el uso. Revisa openrouter.ai o la documentación del proveedor para más detalles.</span>
    </div>
    <label class="modal-checkbox flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-surface-200 cursor-pointer mb-5 select-none">
      <input type="checkbox" id="dont-show-again" class="absolute opacity-0 pointer-events-none" />
      <span class="check-box w-[18px] h-[18px] rounded-[5px] border border-surface-700 bg-surface-500 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 transition-all duration-200 [input:checked+&]:bg-gold [input:checked+&]:border-gold [input:checked+&]:after:content-[''] [input:checked+&]:after:w-2.5 [input:checked+&]:after:h-2.5 [input:checked+&]:after:bg-surface [input:checked+&]:after:[clip-path:polygon(14%_44%,35%_64%,85%_14%,92%_22%,35%_78%,7%_52%)]"></span>
      No volver a mostrar este mensaje
    </label>
    <div class="flex gap-2 justify-end">
      <button id="cost-modal-cancel" class="px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl text-sm font-semibold text-surface-200 hover:bg-gold/10 hover:text-surface-100 transition-all duration-200">Cancelar</button>
      <button id="cost-modal-accept" class="px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl text-sm font-semibold bg-gold text-surface hover:bg-gold-50 transition-all duration-200">Entendido, continuar</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
